 "remarks": "Stunningly updated 2-bedroom, 2.5 bath townhouse in the coveted Greenwich Hills Association. The bright & open main level offers a seamless flow between the kitchen, dining & living room with built-ins & a balcony. The renovated kitchen features stainless-steel appliances & modern finishes. Hardwood floors throughout, high-end fixtures, finishes and updated windows fill the space w/natural light. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite w/vaulted ceilings, a granite bath & generous closet space. A second bedroom and full hallway bath complete the upper level. The finished lower level provides flexible living space perfect for a playroom, home gym, office, or family room, with direct outdoor access to a new stone patio. Community pool and tennis/pickleball court.",
